---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
// import selfImage from '../assets/MyKin/KylanPhoto.jpg';
import selfImage from '../assets/kylanpic.jpg';
const pageTitle = "Kylan Curran";
---
<Layout pageTitle={pageTitle}>

 <p>
	 I graduated from the University of Oregon in December 2025 with a Bachelor's of Science in Art 
     and Technology, and minors in Computer Science and Comics and Cartoon Studies. 
     I have a strong focus in both graphic design and cybersecurity where I am currently seeking a full-time job opportunity.
    I am hardworking, organized, and highly adaptable, with a creative process guided by attention to detail and a strong 
    sense of visual harmony. 
 </p>
 <p>
     My primary goal is to pursue a career in the field of design; particularly graphic design, animation, or game design. 
     However, I am open and eager to exploring different opportunities in this field.

    I am also open to continuing towards a career in cybersecurity. This is a field that I found myself passionate
    about upon contributing to in my student security analyst position at the University of Oregon. 
 </p>
 <p>
  To view some of my earlier works and progression in the field of graphic design and web development, please visit 
  my prior websites and portfolio pieces linked here:
  <a href="https://web-portfolio-kylan.vercel.app/" target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Iteration 1</a>
  <a href="https://kylan-curran-portfolio.vercel.app/" target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Iteration 2</a>
 </p>

  <div class="image-wrapper">
    <Image 
      src={selfImage}
      alt="Kylan Picture"
      loading="eager"
      class="project-image"
    />
  </div>


</Layout>